.TH XD\-MOUSE 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-mouse \- Mouse Properties
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-mouse
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-mouse
is Windows XP's Mouse Properties (Control Panel):
.TP
.B Buttons
Switching the primary and secondary buttons, the double-click speed (with
XP's test folder) and ClickLock.
.TP
.B Pointers
The pointer (XCursor) theme, with a preview of its pointers, and its size.
.TP
.B Pointer Options
The pointer's speed, and Enhance pointer precision (acceleration).
.TP
.B Wheel
How many lines a notch of the wheel scrolls.
.TP
.B Touchpad
Shown when udev knows a touchpad: tap to click (two fingers tapped
right-click, three middle-click), tap and drag, two-finger or edge
scrolling, reverse scrolling and its speed, how a press right-clicks,
turning the touchpad off while typing or while a mouse is plugged in, its
own speed and acceleration, and the desktop's three-finger swipes (down
shows the desktop, up brings the windows back, sideways switches windows).
.TP
.B Hardware
The pointing devices udev knows.
.PP
The settings go to
.IR desktop.ini ,
and
.BR xd\-compositor (1)
applies them to every libinput pointer at once, the
.B Touchpad
tab's to touchpads.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XD_SHOW_TOUCHPAD
Set to 1, the Touchpad tab shows without a touchpad (for screenshots and
tests).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/xeondesktop/desktop.ini
.B [Mouse]
and
.BR [Touchpad] .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xd\-keyboard (1),
.BR xd\-access (1),
.BR xd\-control (1)
